WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,180
Think about how to tell the base.

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,720
Go somewhere else first

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:15,920
Report truthfully

4
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,470
There is an interrogator beside the leader

5
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:24,680
It's impossible to tell lies

6
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,860
no meaning

7
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,060
